  "ruleText": "Saf-C 2604.02 Exception Permit Availability. The application for a permit specified in Saf- C 2604.01 shall be available at the department.\n\nSource. #5752, eff 12-2-93; ss by INTERIM #7140, eff 12-2-99, EXPIRED: 3-31-00\n\nNew. #7905, eff 6-24-03; ss by #8519, eff 12-16-05; ss by #10784, eff 2-13-15",
